OL,3,GNEWSACriticised AI mural of city on pub
OL,4,Awall removed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA controversial mural which was
OL,7,Fgenerated by AI and plastered on the
OL,8,Fwall of a city pub has been removed.
OL,10,FThe vinyl sticker, which was put on the
OL,11,Fside of the Jolly Colliers pub in
OL,12,FBedminster, Bristol, on Wednesday
OL,13,Ffeatured iconic symbols of the city
OL,14,Fsuch as hot air balloons and the
OL,15,FClifton Suspension Bridge.
OL,17,FThe mural, which was located in the
OL,18,Fpart of the city that hosts Europe's
OL,19,Flargest street art festival Upfest, was
OL,20,Fremoved earlier.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
