OL,3,GNEWSACriticised AI mural of city on pub
OL,4,Awall removed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for Punch Pubs & Co,
OL,7,Fwhich owns the pub, said it had nothing
OL,8,Fto add to a previous statement in which
OL,9,Fit said the mural was a "temporary
OL,10,Fsolution" which they were working with
OL,11,Flocal artists to replace.
